    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koterteri Daudi Pilistik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Hiram laitoriatab Turo bik koba oldab Daudi, koipchi taragonik, ak koyokyi bik che waei koik, ak musogikab baoinik, koba koteekyi inendet got. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinai Daudi kole kogogimit Jehovah inendet koek laitoriatab Israel, amu kigitoror bounatennyi, amu bikyik Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiitun Daudi osotik alak eng’ Jerusalem: ak kisich Daudi werik che chang’ ak tibik che chang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak chu ko kainaikab lagok che kisichei eng’ Jerusalem; Samua, Sobab, Natan, ak Solomon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Ibar, Elisua, ak Elpelet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Noga, Nepeg, ak Japia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Elisama, Beeliada, ak Elipelet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogas Pilistik kole, kogiil Daudi koek laitoriatab Israel tugul, kotogosta Pilistik koba kocheng’ Daudi: ak kigas Daudi ak kwo kobargei ak ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiga kobwa Pilistik kobokyi atebwetab Repaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe Daudi Kamuktaindet kolenji, Atogoste awe kebarge ak Pilistik? Ak tos, inde eunnyu ichek? Ak kilenji Jehovah, Togoste, amu andoi ichek eung’ung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotogos anyun kobwa Baal-perasim, ak kibar Daudi ichek eng’ yoto; ak kile Daudi, Kagoiyesta Kamuktaindet bunikyuk eng’ eunnyu, ko u beek che iyestoi. Koguure anyun kainetab koronoto Baal-perasim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibagage oloto kanamonikwak; ak king’at Daudi, ak kigibeel eng’ mat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kita kobokyi kogeny atebwonoto Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteebe Daudi kogeny Kamuktaindet; ak kilenji Kamuktaindet inendet, Amat itogoste isub ichek: ui taban, si iche ichek eng’ ye itoorjingei ketikab logoek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye igas cheetab banda eng’ ketichato bo logoek barak, iwe anyun obarge: amu kagondoenen Kamuktaindet kwo kobar lugetab Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai Daudi ko u ye king’at Kamuktaindet inendet: ak kibar lugetab Pilistik koboch Gibeon agoi Geser. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyom emotinwek tugul toogunatetab Daudi; ak kiigochi Jehovah bororiosiek tugul koiywei inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
